### ==============================================================================
### PWA Store API - Phase 5: Authenticated User Actions (Installations & Reviews)
### Base URL: http://localhost:8000/api/v1
### All routes require Bearer Token (Sanctum)
### Write operations are rate-limited via throttle:write (30 req/min per user)
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api/v1
@contentType = application/json
@acceptJson = application/json
@acceptLanguage = ar
@authToken = <TOKEN>

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. POST /pwas/{slug}/install - أول تثبيت لتطبيق منشور (201 Created)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/pwas/azkar-muslim-app/install
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: {{acceptJson}}
Accept-Language: {{acceptLanguage}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Response: 201 Created
# {
#   "success": true,
#   "message": "تم تثبيت التطبيق بنجاح.",
#   "data": {
#     "installed_at": "2026-11-14T16:00:00.000000Z",
#     "install_count": 351
#   },
#   "errors": null
# }

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. POST /pwas/{slug}/install - تثبيت مكرر (Idempotent: 200 OK دون زيادة العداد)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/pwas/azkar-muslim-app/install
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: {{acceptJson}}
Accept-Language: {{acceptLanguage}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Response: 200 OK
# {
#   "success": true,
#   "message": "التطبيق مثبت لديك مسبقاً.",
#   "data": {
#     "installed_at": "2026-11-14T16:00:00.000000Z",
#     "install_count": 351
#   },
#   "errors": null
# }

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. POST /pwas/{slug}/install - محاولة تثبيت تطبيق غير منشور أو غير موجود (404 Not Found)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/pwas/unpublished-or-draft-app/install
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: {{acceptJson}}
Accept-Language: {{acceptLanguage}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Response: 404 Not Found
# {
#   "success": false,
#   "message": "المورد المطلوب غير موجود.",
#   "data": null,
#   "errors": null
# }

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. POST /pwas/{slug}/install - خطأ عدم المصادقة (401 Unauthorized)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/pwas/azkar-muslim-app/install
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: {{acceptJson}}
Accept-Language: {{acceptLanguage}}

### Response: 401 Unauthorized
# {
#   "success": false,
#   "message": "يجب تسجيل الدخول للوصول إلى هذا المورد.",
#   "data": null,
#   "errors": null
# }

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. GET /me/installations - قائمة تطبيقات المستخدم المثبتة (مرتبة بالأحدث ومقسمة لصفحات)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/me/installations?per_page=12&page=1
Accept: {{acceptJson}}
Accept-Language: {{acceptLanguage}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Response: 200 OK
# {
#   "success": true,
#   "message": "تمت العملية بنجاح.",
#   "data": [
#     {
#       "id": 1,
#       "name": "متجر أذكار المسلم",
